e%20Extraction%20Machine\">Cake Extraction Machine</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Yielothax%20Dimension\">Yielothax Dimension</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>The effect of this machine is a total mystery. It can be seen working in combination with a <a href=\"#/wiki/Millstone\">Millstone</a>. It also serves various purposes in some quests.\nWhen it's activated by a click, it turns into Mysterious Machine (Activated) and looks like this: <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Mysterious Machine (Activated)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mysterious_Machine_Activated_f1b821.gif\" width=\"96\"/></span><br/>Used in the <a href=\"#/quest/elemental-spheres-quest\">Elemental Spheres Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Extraction%20Machine\">Cake Extraction Machine</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/elemental-spheres-quest\">Elemental Spheres Quest</a></li><li>Functional Objects</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/in-service-of-yalahar-quest\">In Service of Yalahar Quest</a></li><li>Low Waters Observatory</li><li>Machines (Objects)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Millstone\">Millstone</a></li><li>Mysterious Machine (Activated)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Noodles%20Academy%20of%20Modern%20Magic\">Noodles Academy of Modern Magic</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["elemental-spheres-quest","in-service-of-yalahar-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"elemental-spheres-quest","quest":"Elemental Spheres Quest","step":"1-1","n":3,"title":"Desligar a máquina","kind":"mention"